    {
        "content": "<p>Have you seen the section on <a href=\"https://lean-lang.org/doc/reference/latest/The--mvcgen--tactic/Predicate-Transformers/#mvcgen-adequacy\">adequacy lemmas</a> in the docs for <code>mvcgen</code>? <code>EStateM.of_wp_run_eq</code> is not exactly your proof (in particular, they connect the <code>run</code> function to the weakest precondition), but you should be able to get where you want to go with them.</p>",
